      "message": "fix(ui): Simulate says when the stock is hidden\n\nWith the Stock row hidden in the Browser, Simulate drew no stock body\nand no voxel body, and nothing said why. The line under the transport\nnow says that the stock is hidden and where to show it. The line goes\nwhen the stock is shown and never shows outside the simulation.\n\nFixes #3315\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
